ス）<span class=\"num hp\">−30</span></div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevB\">重い</span>時価総額19億円と小型で値が飛びやすい<span class=\"num hp\">−10</span></div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevB\">重い</span>売買代金が1日1億円未満（約定しにくい）<span class=\"num hp\">−10</span></div><div class=\"nhead\">TOB素地スコア: 24点（全体2,556位）</div><div class=\"reason\">・PBR 0.65倍 ＝ 解散価値を大きく下回る（+16）</div><div class=\"reason\">・売買代金が薄く市場の目が届きにくい（+4）</div><div class=\"reason\">・グロース市場 ＝ 上場維持メリットが薄く非公開化しやすい（+4）</div><div class=\"discnote\">買収・非公開化されやすい「体質」の順位で、発生の予測ではありません。全体像と注意点は「TOB素地ランキング」ページ（使い方 › その他の機能）へ。</div><div class=\"nhead\">ファンダメンタル指標</div><div class=\"fact\"><span>PER</span><span class=\"num\">-63.7倍</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>PBR</span><span class=\"num\">0.65倍</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>ROE</span><span class=\"num\">-1.0%</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>時価総額</span><span class=\"num\">19億円</span></div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 3)\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 10)\">10年</button></span></div><div class=\"spark sp3\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"80.6\" width=\"320\" height=\"4.900000000000006\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,18.0 6.1,15.4 8.3,14.1 10.4,12.8 12.5,14.1 14.7,13.0 16.8,30.7 19.0,29.9 21.1,38.0 23.2,45.0 25.4,42.1 27.5,34.3 29.6,36.9 31.8,33.0 33.9,33.0 36.1,35.6 38.2,35.1 40.3,36.9 42.5,35.4 44.6,30.2 46.7,33.0 48.9,31.0 51.0,26.8 53.2,26.0 55.3,27.3 57.4,28.9 59.6,22.9 61.7,21.3 63.8,19.8 66.0,17.7 68.1,27.1 70.2,26.3 72.4,25.2 74.5,26.8 76.7,22.6 78.8,20.8 80.9,30.2 83.1,28.9 85.2,29.7 87.3,27.1 89.5,33.6 91.6,31.0 93.8,29.7 95.9,27.1 98.0,28.9 100.2,28.6 102.3,24.5 104.4,31.2 106.6,34.3 108.7,37.5 110.8,34.6 113.0,27.8 115.1,28.4 117.3,29